# Normalize to LF in-index and on-checkout for everything; Windows scripts below
# override to CRLF. Without eol=lf, core.autocrlf=true expects CRLF in the worktree
# while Node-based tools (Claude Code) write LF -> perpetual phantom "modified".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.md text
*.json text
*.png binary
